00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:06.400
Martin Scorsese film, "The Irishman."

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.670
Robert De Niro and Al Pacino.

00:00:08.670 --> 00:00:10.350
But today, it's not a team-up,

00:00:10.350 --> 00:00:12.360
it's an all-out battle royale to see

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:14.590
who has had the most impressive career,

00:00:14.590 --> 00:00:18.333
