Pacino, De Niro, neither one's Irish.

00:00:32.680 --> 00:00:33.513
Oh well.

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:35.580
- Ha!

00:00:35.580 --> 00:00:37.550
- Here's how I'll determine my winner.

00:00:37.550 --> 00:00:39.650
