00:00:39.650 --> 00:00:41.610
Round two: Tomatometer.

00:00:41.610 --> 00:00:43.990
Round three: most iconic.

00:00:43.990 --> 00:00:45.450
Then we'll do a wild card round

00:00:45.450 --> 00:00:46.950
after which you, the audience,

00:00:46.950 --> 00:00:48.320
will have the final say.

00:00:48.320 --> 00:00:50.290
So without further ado, let's kick off

00:00:50.290 --> 00:00:52.090
what could be the most hotly debated

00:00:52.090 --> 00:00:54.630
episode in the history of this show.

00:00:54.630 --> 00:00:56.820
